Kathryn: Ok.

01:24:16.000 --> 01:24:17.000
Shut the door, please.

01:24:20.000 --> 01:24:22.000
We go on to the hypocrites.

01:24:22.000 --> 01:24:29.000
[2:8] Then there are those who say, We believe in GOD and the Last Day," when in fact they are not believers.

01:24:29.000 --> 01:24:36.000
[2:9] In attempt to deceive GOD and those who believe, they only deceive themselves without perceiving.

01:24:37.000 --> 01:24:44.000
[2:10] In their hears there is a disease. Consequently, GOD augments their disease. They have incurred a painful retribution for their lying.

01:24:44.000 --> 01:24:48.000
[2:11] When they are told, "Do not commit evil," they say, "But we are working righteousness!"

01:24:48.000 --> 01:24:52.000
[2:12] And in fact, they are evildoers, but they do not perceive.

01:24:52.000 --> 01:25:01.000
[2:13] When they are told, "Believe as the people have believed," they say, "Shall we believe like the fools have believed?" In fact, it is they who are the fools, but they do not know.

01:25:01.000 --> 01:25:08.000
[2:14] When they meet the believers, they say, "We believe," but when alone with their devils, they say, "We are still with you; we were only mocking."

01:25:09.000 --> 01:25:13.000
[2:15] GOD mocks them, by leading them in their transgressions, blundering.

01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:20.000
[2:16] It is they who bought the straying, at the expense of guidance. Such trade never prospers, nor do they receive any guidance.

01:25:22.000 --> 01:25:30.000
[2:17] Their example is like those who start a fire, then, as it begins to shed light to them, GOD takes away their light, leaving them in darkness, unable to see.

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:33.000
[2:18] Deaf, dumb, and blind; they fail to return.

01:25:33.000 --> 01:25:43.000
[2:19] For like a storm from the sky in the darkness, thunder, and lightning. They put their fingers in their ears, to evade the lightning bolt and death. God thus surrounds the disbelievers.

01:25:44.000 --> 01:25:52.000
